.TH NEWSGEN 6.SH NAMEnewsgen \- a newspaper made up at random.SH SYNOPSIS\fBnewsgen\fR.SH DESCRIPTION\fBnewsgen\fRprints\fBT O D A Y ' S    N E W S\fRwith the date, a top story built at random from public figures, deeds,places and reactions -- famous people of the early 1980s, and cartooncharacters among them -- and then the weather.  Every run is different..PPIts usage line also offers\fBnews lp\fR,\fRa form for a printer; at a terminal it asks for more memory thanthere is and prints little.  Use it plain..SH SEE ALSOfortune, spew, rstory